:: Buy Consumable [nobr]

<<set _item to $BuyConsumableItem>>
<<set _price to $BuyConsumablePrice>>

<<if $Money >= _price>>
    <<set $Money -= _price>>
    <<run $PlayerInventoryConsumables.addItem(_item)>>
    You bought <<=_item.getName()>>!
<<else>>
    Not enough money. (Got $<<=$Money>>, need $<<=_price>>)
<</if>>

<br><br>
[[Go Back|previous()]]
